      "message": "musig: test that failed nonce parsing invalidates the output\n\nParse a valid nonce into an object, then parse an invalid encoding into\nthe same object, and check that the object is cleared and rejected by\nserialize and by nonce_agg (for a pubnonce) or nonce_process (for an\naggnonce). Also check the case where in66 is NULL.\n\nAn all-zero encoding is a valid aggnonce (both points at infinity), so\nthe aggnonce test uses an invalid prefix byte instead.\n\nThese checks fail without the previous commit.",
