      "message": "musig: clear partial sig output before checking in32\n\npartial_sig_parse cleared its output only after both ARG_CHECKs, so a\nNULL in32 left a previously parsed signature in place. Clear it right\nafter checking sig, as the nonce parsers now do. Adjust the NULL in32\ntest to use a temporary object and check that it is cleared.",
